{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main1300_rival_01",
      "hash": "76a38f0c21048f9d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main1300_rival_02",
      "hash": "76a38c0c21048a84",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "终于追上你了……！\\c\\n我也得到绿色徽章咯！\\c\\n这么一来，\\n我也能去宝可梦联盟了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main1300_rival_03",
      "hash": "76a38d0c21048c37",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我听别人说，\\n四天王的实力强得不得了……\\c\\n但我们非去挑战不可对吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main1300_rival_06",
      "hash": "76a3880c210483b8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]你\\n有没有足够的觉悟呢？\\c\\n用你训练的宝可梦来告诉我吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main1300_rival_04",
      "hash": "76a38a0c2104871e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……我从小就一直在想，\\n自己必须要为[VAR TRNAME(0000)]你\\r\\n做好榜样才行。\\c\\n但是在训练家才能这方面，\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]你其实\\r\\n远远在我之上……"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main1300_rival_05",
      "hash": "76a38b0c210488d1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我还是第一次体会到\\n“不甘心”的滋味。\\c\\n大概是因为我太喜欢\\n当宝可梦训练家的感觉了吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main1300_rival_07",
      "hash": "76a3890c2104856b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我无论如何\\n还是不想承认我真的输了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main1300_rival_08",
      "hash": "76a3860c21048052",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……虽然看上去很傻，\\n这次就让我先走一步吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p05_field_r022",
      "hash": "da4688279a72feb1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 8]"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p06_field_r022",
      "hash": "020d30839e4eb4b6",
      "flags": 0,
